{"id":3092,"date":"2025-11-30T22:44:57","date_gmt":"2025-11-30T22:44:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3092"},"modified":"2026-02-14T23:11:54","modified_gmt":"2026-02-14T23:11:54","slug":"cardboard-juice-bottle-carriers","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-juice-bottle-carriers\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Juice Bottle Carriers"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"60\">Cardboard Juice Bottle Carriers For Everyday Drink Brands<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"666\">Cardboard juice bottle carriers help juice bars, caf\u00e9s, beverage brands, and takeaway counters move bottles from counter to customer with less handling effort. In many shops, the same service area holds snacks and fresh produce packed in <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-fruit-packaging-boxes\/\"><strong>Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes<\/strong><\/a>, so carriers are often planned to match the same organised layout. These units are commonly made for 2-pack, 4-pack, and 6-pack sets, keeping bottles upright and spaced while the handle supports one-hand carrying. Using one consistent carrier format across orders helps staff follow the same packing step during busy and quiet shifts.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"1211\">The cardboard frame holds each bottle in its own slot, which limits side-to-side movement during walking or short transport. This is useful for glass bottles and taller plastic bottles that can knock together. Carriers can be used for flavoured drinks, cold-pressed bottles, detox blends, and chilled juices in the same format. Keeping the same footprints for most orders can help counters, shelves, and pickup areas stay arranged predictably. It also supports training, because the loading method stays the same across shift changes.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1266\">Why Juice Bottle Carriers Support Smoother Service<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1746\">Carriers give staff a repeatable way to handle multiple drinks in a single grip. Instead of using loose bottles or adding extra bags, staff can place each bottle into a slot and check the balance before handover. This can reduce tipping during counter handover and during walking on uneven paths or stairs. A carrier shifts load to the handle and frame so bottles have less contact with each other, which helps limit label rubbing and reduces cap movement caused by repeated knocks.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"2081\">For customers, a single carry point can make it easier to move several bottles to cars, offices, or seating areas. The same structure can be used for everyday orders, mixed orders for groups, and small family packs. When the same carrier is used repeatedly, it becomes easier for staff to stage orders and keep pickup areas arranged.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2129\"><strong data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2129\">Benefits Of Juice Bottle Carrier Packaging<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2647\">\n<li data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2193\">\n<p data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2193\">Helps bottles stay upright and spaced apart during carrying<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2263\">\n<p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2263\">Reduces contact between glass or plastic surfaces inside the pack<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2321\">\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2321\">Keeps labels clearer by limiting friction and rubbing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2390\">\n<p data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2390\">Provides easy-grip handles that support short-distance transport<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2447\">\n<p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2447\">Assembles quickly, which supports peak service times<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2515\">\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2515\">Works across common bottle heights and widths within set ranges<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2571\">\n<p data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2571\">Helps staff confirm balance once bottles are loaded<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2647\">\n<p data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2647\">Supports grouped presentation on counters and in chilled display spaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2699\"><strong data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2699\">Service Improvements Brands Gain From Carriers<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2773\">Staff can hand over 2, 4, or 6 drinks at once without extra packaging<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2848\">Counters stay clearer because loose bottles do not gather around tills<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2920\">Orders for offices, events, or group visits become easier to manage<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2997\">Delivery partners can move chilled bottles with fewer shifts in the pack<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3066\">Mixed orders with different flavours stay grouped in one carrier<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3136\">Shops can keep carrier stacks near workstations for faster access<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3201\">Fewer drops can reduce product loss and refund conversations<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3275\">Consistent presentation keeps bottle sets arranged in the same format<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"4014\">\n<thead data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3404\">\n<tr data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3404\">\n<th data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3291\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3290\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3305\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3304\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3328\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3327\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3352\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3351\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3379\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3378\">Add-ons and Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3404\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3402\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"4014\">\n<tr data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3575\">\n<td data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bottle slots<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3475\">2, 4, and 6-bottle layouts<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3496\">Kraft or white SBS<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3520\">Gloss, matte, spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3551\">Die-cut dividers and handles<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3575\">Juice bars and caf\u00e9s<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3727\">\n<td data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3592\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Grip strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3620\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-hand carrying support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3647\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated or rigid card<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3667\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced handle bridges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Takeaway counters and kiosks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3874\">\n<td data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Space for branding and text<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3794\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10pt\u201328pt board grades<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3820\">UV highlights if needed<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3844\">Logo, icons, QR codes<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3874\">Retail-facing bottle packs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"4014\">\n<td data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Structure<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3912\">Pre-cut folding design<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3912\" data-end=\"3931\">Kraft paperboard<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3952\">Soft-touch options<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3973\">Extra crease lines<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"4014\">Cold drink counters and pop-up stalls<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4073\">Wholesale Juice Bottle Carriers For High Volume Supply<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4541\">Busy juice stalls, caf\u00e9 chains, and beverage manufacturers often use wholesale carriers to manage high-volume hours. Many teams plan these needs alongside <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong>Food Related Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>,\u00a0so packaging for bottles, snacks, and small food items follows one coordinated system. When carriers arrive in bulk cartons, shops can keep stock ready for seasonal peaks, weekend rushes, and planned menu periods. This reduces the chance of stock gaps that can slow counter service.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4949\">Wholesale carriers normally ship flat, which reduces storage space and keeps cartons easier to stack in back rooms, under counters, or near packing benches. During order surges, staff can pull from a stack, fold the carrier along pre-scored lines, and load bottles using the same routine. Using one consistent carrier style supports predictable handling across different staff members and different shifts.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"5000\">How Wholesale Supply Speeds Up Drink Handling<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5002\" data-end=\"5360\">Keeping carriers near work areas removes a common delay in takeaway drink service. Staff do not need to search for an alternative pack when a four-bottle order or an office pickup comes in. Folding becomes routine, so carriers can move from flat to ready with fewer steps. This is useful during lunchtime and early evening peaks when counter time is limited.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5719\"><strong data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5719\">Advantages Of Wholesale Bottle Carrier Supply<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"6242\">\n<li data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5780\">\n<p data-start=\"5722\" data-end=\"5780\">Flat-packed units stack neatly in a limited backroom space<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5781\" data-end=\"5853\">\n<p data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"5853\">Stable stock levels support extended busy periods and seasonal peaks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5854\" data-end=\"5920\">\n<p data-start=\"5856\" data-end=\"5920\">Lightweight handling keeps folding and loading quick for the staff<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5977\">\n<p data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5977\">Bulk pricing can reduce the packaging cost per drink set<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5978\" data-end=\"6043\">\n<p data-start=\"5980\" data-end=\"6043\">Consistent designs simplify training across multiple branches<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6044\" data-end=\"6108\">\n<p data-start=\"6046\" data-end=\"6108\">Reliable supply reduces the need for last-minute substitutes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6109\" data-end=\"6172\">\n<p data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6172\">Shared carrier styles keep the same format across locations<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6173\" data-end=\"6242\">\n<p data-start=\"6175\" data-end=\"6242\">Pre-bundled quantities make counting and reordering more accurate<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6291\"><strong data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6291\">Efficiency Gains During High Demand Periods<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"6294\" data-end=\"6358\">Ready-to-fold carriers shorten the time between order and handover<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6361\" data-end=\"6426\">Teams spend less time looking for suitable bags or alternatives<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6429\" data-end=\"6494\">Standard sizes help staff pick the right carrier for each order<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6497\" data-end=\"6564\">Clear folding patterns reduce mistakes when new staff join shifts<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6567\" data-end=\"6634\">Branches can share stock more easily when units follow one design<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6701\">Delivery-focused outlets can keep carriers near loading points<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6704\" data-end=\"6771\">Predictable packaging supports weekly and seasonal ordering plans<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6774\" data-end=\"6834\">Stable carriers can reduce the need to double-pack bottles<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"6836\" data-end=\"7637\">\n<thead data-start=\"6836\" data-end=\"6963\">\n<tr data-start=\"6836\" data-end=\"6963\">\n<th data-start=\"6836\" data-end=\"6850\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6838\" data-end=\"6849\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"6850\" data-end=\"6864\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6863\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"6864\" data-end=\"6887\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6866\" data-end=\"6886\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"6887\" data-end=\"6911\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"6910\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"6911\" data-end=\"6938\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"6913\" data-end=\"6937\">Add-ons and Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"6938\" data-end=\"6963\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"6940\" data-end=\"6961\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"6990\" data-end=\"7637\">\n<tr data-start=\"6990\" data-end=\"7171\">\n<td data-start=\"6990\" data-end=\"7004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bulk orders<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7004\" data-end=\"7049\" data-col-size=\"md\">From low hundreds to large production runs<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7049\" data-end=\"7075\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft or recycled board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7075\" data-end=\"7103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss or matte outer coat<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7124\">Die-cuts and slots<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"7124\" data-end=\"7171\">Juice production units and central kitchens<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7172\" data-end=\"7335\">\n<td data-start=\"7172\" data-end=\"7193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Storage efficiency<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7193\" data-end=\"7217\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ships and stores flat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7217\" data-end=\"7237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fiberboard blends<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7237\" data-end=\"7266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth or lightly textured<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7266\" data-end=\"7291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printed folding guides<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7291\" data-end=\"7335\" data-col-size=\"md\">Restaurants and caf\u00e9s with limited space<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7336\" data-end=\"7488\">\n<td data-start=\"7336\" data-end=\"7355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Carrier strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7355\" data-end=\"7390\" data-col-size=\"md\">Planned for mixed bottle weights<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7390\" data-end=\"7410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated flutes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7410\" data-end=\"7432\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scratch layers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7432\" data-end=\"7450\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Layered handles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7450\" data-end=\"7488\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cold drink vendors and food trucks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7489\" data-end=\"7637\">\n<td data-start=\"7489\" data-end=\"7505\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding area<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7505\" data-end=\"7526\" data-col-size=\"md\">Print-ready panels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7526\" data-end=\"7547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">White-coated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7547\" data-end=\"7569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PMS or CMYK colours<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7569\" data-end=\"7601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zones for labels and stickers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7601\" data-end=\"7637\" data-col-size=\"md\">Seasonal ranges and menu periods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"7639\" data-end=\"7700\">Practical Drink Carriers That Support Daily Takeaway Sales<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7702\" data-end=\"8263\">Cardboard drink carriers act as a steady frame for groups of bottled drinks that need to leave the counter in a controlled way. They can be used with both glass and plastic containers and help reduce knocks that may loosen caps or cause leaks. In many setups, these carriers sit alongside other packaging sourced through <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/strong><\/a>, so service-area packing formats stay consistent. Fresh juices, smoothies, flavoured milks, energy blends, and wellness shots can be handled through the same carrier family, which keeps packing routines consistent.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8265\" data-end=\"8670\">The design groups multiple bottles into one unit, which makes it easier for staff to pass orders across counters, drive-through windows, or event tables. Customers use one carry point rather than holding several bottles at once. After reaching cars, homes, or offices, bottles can be placed down together without rolling across surfaces. Slot separation reduces contact and movement during short journeys.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"8672\" data-end=\"8720\">How Drink Carriers Support Everyday Handling<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8722\" data-end=\"9103\">A carrier can feel simpler to carry when the handle, base, and slot layout keep the weight balanced. This helps during short walks, crowd movement, and stairs because the bottles stay separated and upright. The same layout can also help groups identify flavours quickly when labels face outward. In shared settings, bottles can be placed down together without taking extra table space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9105\" data-end=\"9151\"><strong data-start=\"9105\" data-end=\"9151\">Customer-Facing Benefits Of Drink Carriers<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"9152\" data-end=\"9697\">\n<li data-start=\"9152\" data-end=\"9226\">\n<p data-start=\"9154\" data-end=\"9226\">Supports a variety of bottle sizes and shapes within one design family<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9227\" data-end=\"9297\">\n<p data-start=\"9229\" data-end=\"9297\">Keeps bottles upright during walking, driving, or public transport<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9298\" data-end=\"9367\">\n<p data-start=\"9300\" data-end=\"9367\">Helps manage multiple drinks during takeaway and short deliveries<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9368\" data-end=\"9405\">\n<p data-start=\"9370\" data-end=\"9405\">Reduces drops when hands are full<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9406\" data-end=\"9488\">\n<p data-start=\"9408\" data-end=\"9488\">Allows carriers to be stacked near counters for quick access during peak times<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9489\" data-end=\"9549\">\n<p data-start=\"9491\" data-end=\"9549\">Keeps bottles grouped in one unit for pickup and staging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9550\" data-end=\"9623\">\n<p data-start=\"9552\" data-end=\"9623\">Supports repeat packing routines when the same carrier format is used<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9624\" data-end=\"9697\">\n<p data-start=\"9626\" data-end=\"9697\">Extends logo and product visibility when carriers move with customers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"9699\" data-end=\"9748\"><strong data-start=\"9699\" data-end=\"9748\">Service Uses Across Different Drink Occasions<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"9751\" data-end=\"9794\">Office orders collected from nearby caf\u00e9s<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9797\" data-end=\"9859\">Event stalls handing out mixed bottles to staff and visitors<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9862\" data-end=\"9924\">Drive-through lanes passing multiple bottles through windows<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9927\" data-end=\"9978\">Family orders for parks, picnics, and short trips<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"9981\" data-end=\"10036\">Meeting deliveries for training sessions or workshops<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10039\" data-end=\"10087\">Wellness programs sending mixed bottled drinks<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10090\" data-end=\"10150\">Retail cold shelves where staff pre-pack multi-bottle sets<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10153\" data-end=\"10207\">Market kiosks and festivals serving takeaway bottles<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"10209\" data-end=\"11008\">\n<thead data-start=\"10209\" data-end=\"10336\">\n<tr data-start=\"10209\" data-end=\"10336\">\n<th data-start=\"10209\" data-end=\"10223\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10211\" data-end=\"10222\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"10223\" data-end=\"10237\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10225\" data-end=\"10236\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"10237\" data-end=\"10260\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10239\" data-end=\"10259\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"10260\" data-end=\"10284\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10262\" data-end=\"10283\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"10284\" data-end=\"10311\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10286\" data-end=\"10310\">Add-ons and Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"10311\" data-end=\"10336\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"10313\" data-end=\"10334\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"10363\" data-end=\"11008\">\n<tr data-start=\"10363\" data-end=\"10524\">\n<td data-start=\"10363\" data-end=\"10381\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bottle capacity<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10381\" data-end=\"10412\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Holds pairs, fours, or sixes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10412\" data-end=\"10436\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, duplex, or SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10436\" data-end=\"10453\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte or gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10453\" data-end=\"10485\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra slots or insert options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10485\" data-end=\"10524\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Takeaway beverages and chilled sets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"10525\" data-end=\"10672\">\n<td data-start=\"10525\" data-end=\"10541\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Handle design<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10541\" data-end=\"10568\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-hand carrying layout<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10568\" data-end=\"10588\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick board stock<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10588\" data-end=\"10616\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft-touch or smooth feel<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10616\" data-end=\"10642\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced top sections<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10642\" data-end=\"10672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Caf\u00e9s, stalls, and pop-ups<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"10673\" data-end=\"10827\">\n<td data-start=\"10673\" data-end=\"10686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Side walls<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10686\" data-end=\"10715\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Helps reduce bottle knocks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10715\" data-end=\"10739\" data-col-size=\"sm\">E-flute or rigid card<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10739\" data-end=\"10763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scratch coatings<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10763\" data-end=\"10791\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rounded or smoothed edges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10791\" data-end=\"10827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail fridges and display units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"10828\" data-end=\"11008\">\n<td data-start=\"10828\" data-end=\"10850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand customisation<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10850\" data-end=\"10884\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Zones for logos and information<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10884\" data-end=\"10912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK or spot colour print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10912\" data-end=\"10935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV accents if needed<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10935\" data-end=\"10973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Areas for product names and details<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"10973\" data-end=\"11008\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Juice brands and branded kiosks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"460\">Cardboard juice bottle carriers offer strong support for carrying 2-pack, 4-pack, and 6-pack beverage bottles in takeaway shops, caf\u00e9s, and juice bars. Many brands rely on <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"405\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> to source reliable packaging for their bottled drinks. These carriers help keep bottles upright, reduce movement, and provide a secure grip during transport.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":4551,"template